      "en": "A **business case** = the financial argument for a project. **ROI** (return on investment) = (gain − cost) ÷ cost. The **payback period** = when the investment pays for itself. Give the number and the method: «ROI of 230% in year one (USD 60K saved − USD 18K cost, ÷ USD 18K)»."
