      "en": "The **cost of inaction** = the price of doing nothing (errors, hiring, lost customers) — often the strongest argument. **opportunity cost** = what we lose by choosing this instead of something else. A **run-rate** = the current figure projected over a year («a run-rate of USD 5,000 a month»)."
